{
  "slug": "agent-ping",
  "name": "Agent Ping",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Plays a sound when Claude finishes, asks a question, or needs permission — so you can step away and come back when needed. Configurable sounds, volume, and alert modes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **4 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `config` (Open the Agent Ping settings form)\n- **Hooks** (4): `Stop`, `Notification`, `StopFailure`, `PermissionRequest`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `agent-ping`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-ping@claude-community` from `DavidWilsby/agent-ping`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
